{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"sea balls (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_balls\" title=\"Sea balls\">sea balls</a></b>  <i>(pictured)</i> are also known by a word for \"wild goat fur\" because they look like hairballs regurgitated by goats?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_balls","retrieved":1792922505394},{"title":"Kurt Gloor (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Swiss filmmaker <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_Gloor\" title=\"Kurt Gloor\">Kurt Gloor</a></b><span class=\"nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">'</span>s</span> final film was about prison inmates and people with disabilities on a trekking tour?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kurt_Gloor","retrieved":1792922505396},{"title":"an ancient road (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that parts of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Via_Mansuerisca\" title=\"Via Mansuerisca\">an ancient road</a></b> were exposed following wildfires in Belgium in the summer of 2026?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Via_Mansuerisca","retrieved":1792922505396},{"title":"Erika Yoshida (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erika_Yoshida\" title=\"Erika Yoshida\">Erika Yoshida</a></b> once adapted <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nou_Shou_Sakuretsu_Girl\" title=\"Nou Shou Sakuretsu Girl\">a Vocaloid song</a></b> into a light novel, a manga, and a film?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erika_Yoshida","retrieved":1792922505398},{"title":"Beauty and the Beast (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Kanye West recorded \"<b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_and_the_Beast_(Kanye_West_song)\" title=\"Beauty and the Beast (Kanye West song)\">Beauty and the Beast</a></b>\" in his Tokyo hotel room?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty_and_the_Beast_(Kanye_West_song)","retrieved":1792922505400},{"title":"Jessie Waddell (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jessie_Waddell\" title=\"Jessie Waddell\">Jessie Waddell</a></b>, who founded New York City's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Indian_Day_Parade\" title=\"West Indian Day Parade\">West Indian Day Parade</a>, timed it to fall on the anniversary of her son's death?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jessie_Waddell","retrieved":1792922505402},{"title":"a species of orchid (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neottia_confusa\" title=\"Neottia confusa\">a species of orchid</a></b>  was named for having a smaller lip than others in its genus?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neottia_confusa","retrieved":1792922505408},{"title":"Chew Hock Leong (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Singaporean banker <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chew_Hock_Leong\" title=\"Chew Hock Leong\">Chew Hock Leong</a></b> sold a camera device patent to Kodak in 1930?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chew_Hock_Leong","retrieved":1792922505411},{"title":"Wendy (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wendy_(coyote)\" title=\"Wendy (coyote)\">Wendy</a></b> was known by Studio City residents for her deformed face, which was the result of an infected gunshot wound?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wendy_(coyote)","retrieved":1792922505413},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt8\" data-mw=\"{&quo