.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Yes_Check_Circle_white.svg/120px-Yes_Check_Circle_white.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikivoyage.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" alt=\"DotM\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" data-file-type=\"drawing\" height=\"32\" width=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n\t\t<h2 style=\"font-size:1.25em;\" id=\"Destination_of_the_Month\" class=\"mw-html-heading\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Previous_Destinations_of_the_month\" title=\"Previous Destinations of the month\">Destination of the Month</a></h2>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size:2em;\" id=\"Xi'an\" class=\"mw-html-heading\"><span id=\"Xi.27an\" typeof=\"mw:FallbackId\"></span><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Xi'an\" title=\"Xi'an\">Xi'an</a></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"quote\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Xi'an\" title=\"Xi'an\">China's ancient capital is the home of the Terracotta Warriors and has a history going back several millennia.</a></div>\n\t</div>\n\t<p><span class=\"nolink\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Xi'an&quot;}\"><span title=\"Xi'an\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:XianBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/4/45/XianBanner1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikivoyage.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Xi'an\" data-file-width=\"1710\" data-file-height=\"570\" data-file-type=\"bitmap\" height=\"567\" width=\"1700\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></span></span>\n\t<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\" data-mw=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Xi'an&quot;}\"><a href=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Xi'an\" title=\"Xi'an\"><img resource=\"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/File:XianBanner1.jpg\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikivoyage/en/4/45/XianBanner1.jpg?utm_source=en.wikivoyage.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumb